    "无法读取本地加密数据，原始文件已保留。请检查本机钥匙串或从备份恢复。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "無法讀取本機加密資料，原始檔案已保留。請檢查本機鑰匙圈或從備份還原。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Unable to read local encrypted data. The original files are unchanged. Check this device’s keychain or restore a backup."
